# Unattended Advanced/36 appliance.
#
# The included file defines the machine, media and stations.  Bare `ipl` then
# owns the processor across the guest's idle waits; connect an ordinary
# tn5250 client to the multiplexer (127.0.0.1:2300) and pick a station.
# No monitor restart or instruction-count driving is needed.

do sim36.sim
ipl
